  "changes": [
    "Projects contain their conversation list and visible row menus. Rename, archive/unarchive, confirmed permanent thread deletion and project unregister preserve original operation ownership, drafts and receipt recovery. Project rename updates registry and accepted receipt atomically without moving files.",
    "Manager RPC helpers are bounded and serialized per gateway; queued requests recheck admission at dispatch, and sent requests retain unknown outcomes until helper close. Provider saves survive their own runtime restart while login identity changes remain isolated; accepted saves and failed follow-up reads are distinguished.",
    "Explicit history_stale failures trigger at most two fresh read-only traversals, retaining independent live events and full-history readiness checks. Manual continuation uses the same generation-bound recovery.",
    "Project controls and supported-browser select popups share light/dark styling. Narrow project lists and mobile menu Escape/focus are corrected. Only a custom inline SVG gear opens settings.",
    "Public reasoning summaries are visible by default and separated from raw/detailed reasoning and mixed sync buffers. Official MCP progress is displayed for known items, cleared on completion, and never overrides terminal results. Agent phase labels use supplied protocol values."
  ],
